              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Certificate of authorization for the Grand Prize of the Interastral Peace Corporation's \"New Millennium\" Annual Gala, Amber Era 2000. Features a holographic signature by Louis Fleming. Grants one unconditional waiver for a major liability. Certificate No. 2000-001. Mint condition."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "strong",
