              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A music box left behind by Gopher Wood, the Penaconian \"Dreammaster.\" This collection was provided by a mysterious consignor, who also designated the starting bid: \"For those who know its worth, the secret contained within this music box far exceeds the asking price.\" Excellent condition."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Starting Bid:"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
