                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The prototype behind \"I Get You • Gum,\" the legendary misunderstanding-buster from the hit series"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "This Cosmos Needs No Soap Opera"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ". Chew a piece of Thought-Sync Gel, and you'll instantly tap into whatever was on the previous chewer's mind. This lot has already been chewed, allegedly by a member of the Genius Society. Authenticity cannot be guaranteed."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
